,"gameSubLabel":"","scoreStripSpoilerHeader":"","scoreStripNonSpoilerHeader":"","isNeutral":false,"homeTeam":{"teamId":1610612750,"teamName":"Timberwolves","teamCity":"Minnesota","teamTricode":"MIN","teamSlug":"timberwolves","wins":8,"losses":3,"score":115,"seed":0,"inBonus":null,"timeoutsRemaining":1,"groupWins":2,"groupLosses":0,"periods":[{"period":1,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":28},{"period":2,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":29},{"period":3,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":33},{"period":4,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":25}],"starters":[{"personId":203497,"position":"C","lastName":"Gobert","firstName":"Rudy","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1630163,"position":"PG","lastName":"Ball","firstName":"LaMelo","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1630183,"position":"SF","lastName":"McDaniels","firstName":"Jaden","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1630228,"position":"PF","lastName":"Kuminga","firstName":"Jonathan","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1630245,"position":"SG","lastName":"Dosunmu","firstName":"Ayo","status":"Confirmed"}]},"awayTeam":{"teamId":1610612762,"teamName":"Jazz","teamCity":"Utah","teamTricode":"UTA","teamSlug":"jazz","wins":1,"losses":9,"score":100,"seed":0,"inBonus":null,"timeoutsRemaining":0,"groupWins":0,"groupLosses":1,"periods":[{"period":1,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":25},{"period":2,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":26},{"period":3,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":27},{"period":4,"periodType":"REGULAR","score":22}],"starters":[{"personId":1629637,"position":"C","lastName":"Hayes","firstName":"Jaxson","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1630182,"position":"SF","lastName":"Green","firstName":"Josh","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1641718,"position":"PG","lastName":"George","firstName":"Keyonte","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1642846,"position":"PF","lastName":"Bailey","firstName":"Ace","status":"Confirmed"},{"personId":1643408,"position":"SG","lastName":"Peterson","firstName":"Darryn","status":"Confirmed"}]},"reportModules":[{"moduleType":"game_header","order":0},{"moduleType":"defining_moments","order":1},{"moduleType":"top_performers","order":2},{"moduleType":"shot_difficulty","order":3},{"moduleType":"gravity_spotlight","order":4},{"moduleType":"team_top_sets","order":5},{"moduleType":"defensive_spotlight","order":6},{"moduleType":"leverage_spotlight","order":7}],"gameOverview":{"title":"The Minnesota Timberwolves Earn the Win","body":"The Minnesota Timberwolves defeated the Utah Jazz 115-100. Ayo Dosunmu led Minnesota with 26 points on 7-for-13 shooting, including 4-for-5 from three-point range, while adding 4 rebounds. LaMelo Ball contributed 24 points, 5 assists and 3 rebounds on 10-for-20 from the field. For Utah, Darryn Peterson scored 26 points on 11-for-21 shooting with 6 rebounds and 4 assists, while Keyonte George added 19 points, 8 assists and 5 rebounds in the loss.\n\nThe Jazz mounted an early challenge, going on a 20–8 run in the opening quarter to establish themselves in the contest. Minnesota responded with its own decisive stretch, building an 18–4 run that spanned from the third quarter into the fourth and proved decisive down the stretch. The Minnesota Timberwolves got more scoring support from their bench than the Utah Jazz. Late in the fourth, LaMelo Ball hit a three-pointer that made it 106–92 in favor of the Timberwolves with 3:22 remaining, extending Minnesota's advantage as the team pulled away.\n\nDosunmu shot 7.1 percentage points above expectation, converting at a higher rate than an average NBA player would be expected to convert his tracked shot opportunities. Peterson also shot 7.1 percentage points above expectation in Utah's effort. Jaylen Clark drew above-expected defensive pressure for Minnesota, recording average Gravity of 10.7, while Trey Lyles contributed overall impact with Total Leverage of 2.7 for the Timberwolves."}},"defining_moments":{"gameId":"0022600198","moduleType":"defining_moments","definingMoments":[{"guid":"35067f52-9e8b-fc4d-c812-3149f5b80475","rank":1,"tit